title: "E-Commerce Agents"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent e-commerce platform built with the Microsoft Agent Framework.
  Six specialist agents collaborate over an A2A-style HTTP protocol to handle
  product discovery, orders, pricing, reviews, inventory and customer support,
  with Python and .NET backends.
